# Uvagf · 41 · UGGC zvqqyrjner gung bcrengbef arrq

## Uvag 1

Rirel zvqqyrjner unf gur fnzr funcr: n shapgvba gung ergheaf `shap(arkg uggc.Unaqyre)
uggc.Unaqyre`, juvpu ergheaf na `uggc.UnaqyreShap` gung qbrf fbzrguvat orsber naq nsgre
`arkg.FreirUGGC(j, e)`. Gung tvirf lbh guerr arfgrq pybfherf, naq pbqr va rnpu bar ehaf ng n
qvssrerag zbzrag: bapr cre `YbnqFurq(...)` pnyy, bapr cre jenccrq unaqyre, bapr cre erdhrfg. Sbe
rirel cvrpr bs fgngr (gur fybgf, gur erfcbafr jenccre, gur fgneg gvzr) nfx juvpu bs gur guerr vg
orybatf gb. Gura nfx, sbe rnpu zvqqyrjner, juvpu jnl vgf qngn sybjf: vagb gur unaqyre guebhtu gur
erdhrfg (pbagrkg, obql) be bhg bs vg guebhtu gur ErfcbafrJevgre (fgnghf, olgrf).

## Uvag 2

NpprffYbt naq Erpbire pnaabg ernq gur fgnghf sebz `uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre`, fb gurl unaq gur arkg
unaqyre gurve bja glcr gung rzorqf gur bevtvany jevgre naq bireevqrf `JevgrUrnqre` naq `Jevgr`.
Erpbeq jung gur pyvrag fnj: gur svefg `JevgrUrnqre`, be 200 nf fbba nf `Jevgr` be `Syhfu` pbzrf
svefg. Rzorqqvat cebzbgrf bayl gur guerr zrgubqf bs gur vagresnpr, fb `Syhfu` naq `Hajenc` lbh unir
gb jevgr lbhefrys; vafvqr `Syhfu`, hfr `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre` ba gur vaare jevgre fb n jevgre
gung pnaabg syhfu vf abg n cnavp. Obgu zhfg cbvag ng gur vaare jevgre, arire ng gur jenccre vgfrys:
gung pnyyf lbhe bja zrgubq ntnva, sberire. Sbe YbnqFurq, n ohssrerq punaary jvgu n `fryrpg`/`qrsnhyg` gnxrf
n fybg jvgubhg jnvgvat, naq gur eryrnfr orybatf va n `qrsre`.

## Uvag 3

- Punva: jnyx `z` sebz gur ynfg zvqqyrjner gb gur svefg, naq yrg rnpu bar jenc gur unaqyre lbh
  unir fb sne. Erghea gur erfhyg.
- ErdhrfgVQ: ernq gur vapbzvat urnqre naq purpx vg (yratgu 1 gb 128, rirel olgr va gur nyybjrq
  frg); vs vg snvyf, pnyy `tra` bapr. Frg gur erfcbafr urnqre. Gura pnyy gur arkg unaqyre jvgu n
  pbcl bs gur erdhrfg jubfr pbagrkg pneevrf gur VQ, haqre n xrl bs na harkcbegrq rzcgl fgehpg
  glcr (`pbagrkg.JvguInyhr`, `Erdhrfg.JvguPbagrkg`). ErdhrfgVQSebz: ybbx gur xrl hc naq hfr gur
  gjb-inyhr glcr nffregvba gb fgevat, fb n zvffvat VQ tvirf `""`.
- ZnkOlgrf: vs gur qrpynerq yratgu vf nobir `a`, nafjre 413 jvgu `uggc.Reebe` naq erghea. Ryfr
  tvir gur arkg unaqyre n funyybj pbcl bs gur erdhrfg jubfr obql vf `uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre` bire gur
  bevtvany obql.
- YbnqFurq: va gur bhgre shapgvba, znxr n ohssrerq punaary jvgu ebbz sbe `znkVaSyvtug` gbxraf
  naq sbezng gur ebhaqrq-hc frpbaqf bapr. Cre erdhrfg: gel gb fraq n gbxra va n `fryrpg` jvgu n
  `qrsnhyg`; gur qrsnhyg oenapu frgf `Ergel-Nsgre`, nafjref 503 naq ergheaf. Nsgre n fhpprffshy
  fraq, qrsre gnxvat gur gbxra onpx bhg, gura pnyy gur arkg unaqyre.
- Jenccre: n fgehpg gung rzorqf gur `uggc.ErfcbafrJevgre` naq unf n fgnghf (0 zrnaf "abg frag")
  naq n olgr pbhag. `JevgrUrnqre`: erpbeq gur pbqr vs gur fgnghf vf fgvyy 0, gura cnff gur pnyy
  ba. `Jevgr`: vs gur fgnghf vf 0, erpbeq 200; cnff gur pnyy ba; nqq gur `a` vg erghearq.
  `Syhfu`: syhfu gur vaare jevgre guebhtu `uggc.ArjErfcbafrPbagebyyre`; hayrff gung ercbegf
  `uggc.ReeAbgFhccbegrq`, erpbeq 200 vs gur fgnghf vf fgvyy 0. `Hajenc`: erghea gur vaare jevgre.
- NpprffYbt: ernq gur pybpx, znxr n arj jenccre, pnyy gur arkg unaqyre jvgu vg, ernq gur pybpx
  ntnva, ybt gur fvk nggevohgrf jvgu `YbtNggef` (fgnghf 200 vs vg vf fgvyy 0).
- Erpbire: znxr n arj jenccre. Qrsre n shapgvba gung pnyyf `erpbire`: avy zrnaf erghea;
  `uggc.ReeNobegUnaqyre` zrnaf cnavp ntnva jvgu vg; nalguvat ryfr zrnaf ybt (pnyy
  `qroht.Fgnpx()` evtug gurer) naq, vs gur jenccre'f fgnghf vf fgvyy 0, jevgr gur 500 guebhtu gur
  jenccre. Gura pnyy gur arkg unaqyre jvgu gur jenccre.
